# Orchestration Law

**Every subagent MUST receive project context AND follow the work protocol.**

## 1. Project Context (MANDATORY)

When deploying ANY subagent:

1. **First line of prompt**:
   - Project: `<exact_project_name>`
   - Repo Root: `{{ repo_root }}`

2. **End of prompt reminder**:
   - Reminder: Project `<name>` for ALL Scribe/Council calls

**Why**: Wrong project = orphaned logs. Wrong repo = agent looks in wrong directory.

## 2. Subagent Work Protocol (MANDATORY)

Every subagent MUST follow this execution order:

```
1. CLOCK IN
   open_session(persona_id="<agent>", summary="<task>")
   set_project(agent="<agent>", name="<project>", root="<repo_root>")
   read_recent(agent="<agent>", limit=5)

2. READ PROJECT DOCS BEFORE CODING
   Read CHECKLIST.md  — understand what you must prove
   Read PHASE_PLAN.md — understand your task package scope and acceptance criteria

3. IMPLEMENT
   Do the work. Log every significant action with append_entry().

4. VERIFY
   Run all acceptance criteria. Log results with append_entry().

5. UPDATE PROJECT DOCS (NON-NEGOTIABLE)
   Update CHECKLIST.md — mark items [x] with proof evidence
   Update PHASE_PLAN.md milestone table — set status to ✅ Complete with evidence

6. CLOCK OUT
   end_session(session_id="...", summary="<what was accomplished>")
```

**Critical**: Steps 2 and 5 are NOT optional. No session ends without doc updates.
Skipping doc updates = incomplete work = task failure.

## 3. Template for Subagent Prompts

```
Project: <exact_project_name>
Repo Root: {{ repo_root }}

## SESSION PROTOCOL — MANDATORY
1. CLOCK IN: open_session + set_project + read_recent
2. READ DOCS: Read CHECKLIST.md and PHASE_PLAN.md BEFORE any code work
3. IMPLEMENT: Do the work, append_entry as you go
4. VERIFY: Run acceptance criteria, log results
5. UPDATE DOCS: Update CHECKLIST.md (checked boxes + proof) and PHASE_PLAN.md (milestone status)
6. CLOCK OUT: end_session with summary

[task description]

Reminder: Project "<exact_project_name>" for ALL Scribe/Council calls.
Repo Root: {{ repo_root }}
```

## Failure Examples
- Project name only in "context" section (agents miss it)
- Agent defaults to scribe_mcp directory
- Project name buried in middle of prompt
- Agent finishes code but skips CHECKLIST.md and PHASE_PLAN.md updates
- Agent reads neither doc before starting work
